# Impeccable design-detector hook runtime cache (per-session state, not skill source)
.claude/skills/impeccable/scripts/.impeccable/

## Skills installed by `npx skills` — the lockfile travels, the payload does not.
## `skills-lock.json` records the source and a content hash for each one, so a
## clone reproduces exactly these versions with `npx skills add`. Vendoring the
## folders as well would put a third party's prose under our own review burden
## and duplicate what the hash already pins. `impeccable` is the exception and
## is deliberately tracked: it is this project's own, edited here, not fetched.
.agents/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/impeccable/
